    {
      "text": "This article describes how to create user groups on the User Groups page. You can use a CSV file to add multiple groups at once. Before you create a user group, ensure that you have added the users that you want to include in a group, or you can also assign a group to the user when configuring a user. To configure users, see Adding Users."
    },
    {
      "text": "To add a new group:"
    },
